<title>UK: SOCCER-GLASGOW RANGERS 0 AJAX 1 LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GLASGOW RANGERS 0 AJAX 1 LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ajax Amsterdam led Glasgow Rangers 1-0 in their European Champions' League group A match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Arnold Scholten 39</p>
